N2  - The first 4 cases of subnasal transphenoidal hypophysectomy operated on in Venezuela according to Hardy's procedure are presented. The technique, the pre and operative radiologic studies and the use of the operating microscope are described in detail. The advantages and indications for the approach, and some of its complications are pointed out.
